  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Among the various columns in newspapers, one that consistently captures my interest—always excluding those I contribute to myself—is the section called \"The World's Press.\"",
      "output_sha256": "353ebc4a1621e7a9d3b2837d8317d0f936853555d40d4cd0dd713e9e2cd3faa1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": 0.409222,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a373015e72b66225037be0e39e0cad941b0476963071b171dce863178bd60407"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_ai_sha256": "353ebc4a1621e7a9d3b2837d8317d0f936853555d40d4cd0dd713e9e2cd3faa1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1,
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "This feature offers a glimpse into the perspectives of publications that often fly under the radar for most readers.",
      "output_sha256": "11cdf279495876796483be78e6bd58a4c1acfa6c1be5b1cc93db281d35dc3d07",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": 0.409222,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a373015e72b66225037be0e39e0cad941b0476963071b171dce863178bd60407"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_ai_sha256": "11cdf279495876796483be78e6bd58a4c1acfa6c1be5b1cc93db281d35dc3d07",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1,
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Recently, I stumbled upon The Shoe Manufacturers' Monthly, a periodical that the discerning crowd eagerly anticipates each month.",
      "output_sha256": "a1481838d19dacba9f167989c71b1eb810e9c617c7986ba6e51bc71c63630096",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": 0.392481,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ad6fc00f85c6c5b6d3333ff422f5bc18b52bc5e709e7cd85cd276a6f2f8a20e8"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a1481838d19dacba9f167989c71b1eb810e9c617c7986ba6e51bc71c63630096",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Its former competitor, The Footwear Fortnightly, seems to have faded from relevance.",
      "output_sha256": "971d08e581ffc286afd43aad3639dbde415baf302566c113728a9f08ee75378e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": 0.402747,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6d80397edb5d77580a0a835660757bb99de166a49b8b84d81fd164a16f0d5225"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_ai_sha256": "971d08e581ffc286afd43aad3639dbde415baf302566c113728a9f08ee75378e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The bon mot of the current number of The S.M.M. is a note to the effect that Kaffirs have a special fondness for boots which make a noise.",
      "output_sha256": "def2d6f619f75234580fcadab1fb41d0593088b80b1eb8105b7e5e544b8c213e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "def2d6f619f75234580fcadab1fb41d0593088b80b1eb8105b7e5e544b8c213e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I quote this simply as an excuse for referring to the old problem of the squeaky boots and the squeaky collar; the problem, in fact, of the unfairness of things.",
      "output_sha256": "376a3cabfc3f7e9dbb8787d322588350b38eba71739ae7434efa9cf6d8473fb5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "376a3cabfc3f7e9dbb8787d322588350b38eba71739ae7434efa9cf6d8473fb5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The majors and clubmen who assist their country with columns of advice on clothes have often tried to explain why a collar squeaks, but have never done so to the satisfaction of any man of intelligence.",
      "output_sha256": "0a18d36df4454a0466a85ab56cc21941198912fb2e85835f1b94eee68dfaf4e8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "0a18d36df4454a0466a85ab56cc21941198912fb2e85835f1b94eee68dfaf4e8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "They say that the collar is too large or too small, too dirty or too clean.",
      "output_sha256": "5d16beb56779d8de77c265d68501283dc6062f922f79f8a436b00ea9bcbbec48",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "5d16beb56779d8de77c265d68501283dc6062f922f79f8a436b00ea9bcbbec48",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "They say that if you have your collars made for you (like a gentleman) you will be all right, but that if you buy the cheap, ready-made article, what can you expect?",
      "output_sha256": "0da9d80419f98b5992f3108654f68ae6d1f9084fd102471865a5b6b864619c51",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "0da9d80419f98b5992f3108654f68ae6d1f9084fd102471865a5b6b864619c51",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "They say that a little soap on the outside of the shirt, or a little something on the inside of something else, that this, that, and the other will abate the nuisance.",
      "output_sha256": "68ee2299868797f35102489b322b4989431373d4ab9170627fd4f734027bb78e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "68ee2299868797f35102489b322b4989431373d4ab9170627fd4f734027bb78e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "They are quite wrong.",
      "output_sha256": "df342f410c3cb0a626d0aabbf47a13361390ad09da11c8aa1e83eb2d13600905",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "df342f410c3cb0a626d0aabbf47a13361390ad09da11c8aa1e83eb2d13600905",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The simple truth, and everybody knows it really, is that collars squeak for some people and not for others.",
      "output_sha256": "e782a79277d83114674f6e1f4aa96788f671a023f73dd088d973c583cfa60ab1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "e782a79277d83114674f6e1f4aa96788f671a023f73dd088d973c583cfa60ab1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "A squeaky collar round the neck of a man is a comment, not upon the collar, but upon the man.",
      "output_sha256": "06b230a89955d7e88066d8d25ff8b945d5a2b6426bda923bc8639e212d6a50ec",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "06b230a89955d7e88066d8d25ff8b945d5a2b6426bda923bc8639e212d6a50ec",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "That man is unlucky.",
      "output_sha256": "8305660ae53d41564e2585c29e9ad585de0ffede69ee6ff11a094e24c0344e36",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "8305660ae53d41564e2585c29e9ad585de0ffede69ee6ff11a094e24c0344e36",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Things are against him.",
      "output_sha256": "639bb667053a073eddd02634c272108320d695bcdcf9d8602625ad69da69b0bc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "639bb667053a073eddd02634c272108320d695bcdcf9d8602625ad69da69b0bc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Nature may have done all for him that she could, have given him a handsome outside and a noble inside, but the world of inanimate objects is against him.",
      "output_sha256": "65b7d763ec3f2d70b697f600e1fdb8dbd2c66b6c10a397f0d11fb0babee57cd2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "65b7d763ec3f2d70b697f600e1fdb8dbd2c66b6c10a397f0d11fb0babee57cd2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "We all know that one individual who naturally attracts the affection of children and dogs.",
      "output_sha256": "9e7c4d290472c64f4ce3f99e43d20bb62b77d014ecc16882ddd03802fb035ebf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.496667,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9d82d31bf4508bbeb5bfd6dc7bbf7a38dc24ec76e9d16c13f6b648ba2fcbd21f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9e7c4d290472c64f4ce3f99e43d20bb62b77d014ecc16882ddd03802fb035ebf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "This rare ability to inspire such fondness is a sign of good fortune.",
      "output_sha256": "1e9bd0ed917848be072884ad472b2a57429583318f4c42de8ae90da521457031",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.311161,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "00c8108719e69317f2a353d8b81a8cd60f920ce45c0e0ae6020c55a6549710d3"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1e9bd0ed917848be072884ad472b2a57429583318f4c42de8ae90da521457031",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The Fates have been kind to him.",
      "output_sha256": "4a53c58960f27a90f7f79d2cfb7c4f0b2abd0fa015dde4f588ea44091f3d354e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "4a53c58960f27a90f7f79d2cfb7c4f0b2abd0fa015dde4f588ea44091f3d354e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But to inspire the affection of inanimate things is something greater.",
      "output_sha256": "c98c35903ed4f9aacdff90e80149e5be2177f0c45c25ff0f5f00560575304e65",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "c98c35903ed4f9aacdff90e80149e5be2177f0c45c25ff0f5f00560575304e65",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "A man whose collar or window sash seems to take to him instinctively is truly someone favored by luck.",
      "output_sha256": "46dd8b7520f096e6b784bde3a9ab1d9697e670f9d92a13f6c513123217bd64c2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": 0.442821,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "892007e18bcbbf94c1ffd60cb092c5a72d787331ae6af65b1d181c3efe31f95e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_ai_sha256": "46dd8b7520f096e6b784bde3a9ab1d9697e670f9d92a13f6c513123217bd64c2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Consider him for a moment.",
      "output_sha256": "1c21eda0ce1fb0dba630345bef17f40acb6469d357db1534f5ac51dde91fa7aa",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "1c21eda0ce1fb0dba630345bef17f40acb6469d357db1534f5ac51dde91fa7aa",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "His collar never squeaks; his clothes take a delight in fitting him.",
      "output_sha256": "fa2a0a5aa5891ccd500e5e058ab4c83b24b5001e0c32843a1af1a6f22147e134",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "fa2a0a5aa5891ccd500e5e058ab4c83b24b5001e0c32843a1af1a6f22147e134",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "At a dinner- party he walks as by instinct straight to his seat, what time you and I are dragging our partners round and round the table in search of our cards.",
      "output_sha256": "77b39d909b0dd3e2d1b0748258cdf66bc65f8bb4898ca0a56728dee3f3f3c04b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "77b39d909b0dd3e2d1b0748258cdf66bc65f8bb4898ca0a56728dee3f3f3c04b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The windows of taxicabs open to him easily.",
      "output_sha256": "dc71e739717985d5167725f5296d1b60f04f4955df7eba3e248eeb22ac8fcec1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "dc71e739717985d5167725f5296d1b60f04f4955df7eba3e248eeb22ac8fcec1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "When he travels by train his luggage works its way to the front of the van and is the first to jump out at Paddington.",
      "output_sha256": "86d6aa0be497bb970217658f7e331213277c13e3be40aeec6dbe7521834630fb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "86d6aa0be497bb970217658f7e331213277c13e3be40aeec6dbe7521834630fb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "String untangles itself upon his approach, and he is the only one capable of making a lasting impression with sealing wax.",
      "output_sha256": "9a0d5049018c61cb032652f6fc66d953f7259ee3fc3792b19cb7fb952e3779de",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": 0.497403,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7974ac1d66fe9a6dff8bbcab759b42892850c6ec864b732955619e07cdc6f47b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9a0d5049018c61cb032652f6fc66d953f7259ee3fc3792b19cb7fb952e3779de",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "If he is asked by the hostess in a crowded drawing-room to ring the bell, that bell comes out from behind the sofa where it hid from us and places itself in a convenient spot before his eyes.",
      "output_sha256": "f397575a417125aa4f79523423dbb6acd9fa2aad1454c8eb2c32823d9f724483",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "f397575a417125aa4f79523423dbb6acd9fa2aad1454c8eb2c32823d9f724483",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Asparagus stiffens itself at sight of him, macaroni winds itself round his fork.",
      "output_sha256": "88733e0a0b5044c1926e9f41f29e30a8322edddb88a5dbfc30b75a50c21dae52",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "88733e0a0b5044c1926e9f41f29e30a8322edddb88a5dbfc30b75a50c21dae52",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "It is important to note that I am not merely addressing the typical fortunate individual.",
      "output_sha256": "de478db8acdf6e1f694676d568289002f03f0e7470046c88feed689f488ec215",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.354048,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2798175506c1925b067b275cb8422bc4c5e654af579de0fbc75e70e7e5f60573"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_ai_sha256": "de478db8acdf6e1f694676d568289002f03f0e7470046c88feed689f488ec215",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Such a person might suffer losses on the Stock Exchange or experience heartbreak; they may find themselves in unfortunate situations, like a railway accident.",
      "output_sha256": "1198af7af58277d9376b0b575a40cf18e7afbc18c41d547877d04738bfd8f665",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": 0.291364,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "df9919d6ef4a0573f62a088aa009e9eaad8a25316e3fecabeeab6283de83e460"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1198af7af58277d9376b0b575a40cf18e7afbc18c41d547877d04738bfd8f665",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "That is a kind of ill-luck which one can bear, not indeed without grumbling, but without rancour.",
      "output_sha256": "21856862ad2370ea781156f668130d4e7efacdd3e552c3bf86fb9ab6d0dc55bc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "21856862ad2370ea781156f668130d4e7efacdd3e552c3bf86fb9ab6d0dc55bc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "In contrast, the individual who suffers at the hands of inanimate objects garners no sympathy.",
      "output_sha256": "1d2aebea84312cc87d421f96a491c291dbc071a8a65fb396beb5f8919d63428f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": 0.344643,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a88c0e208312ce0bc76d094680c3486994772fdbe484b0d938b8385a25ac16e4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1d2aebea84312cc87d421f96a491c291dbc071a8a65fb396beb5f8919d63428f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        29,
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "We could be on a bus that tips over, and no one would blame us for it.",
      "output_sha256": "b4c923fb0c5b1cf0a6b4c46072a99893a8d3fc488f0ff70e97aae34aaaf3edc7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": 0.344643,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a88c0e208312ce0bc76d094680c3486994772fdbe484b0d938b8385a25ac16e4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b4c923fb0c5b1cf0a6b4c46072a99893a8d3fc488f0ff70e97aae34aaaf3edc7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        29,
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We may be on a motor bus which overturns and nobody will say that it is our fault, but if our collar deliberately and maliciously squeaks, everybody will say that we ought to buy better collars; if our dinner cards hide from us, or the string of our parcel works itself into knots, we are called clumsy; our asparagus and macaroni give us a reputation for bad manners; our luggage gets us a name for dilatoriness.",
      "output_sha256": "41415bfc18c50a24c187631df532d2f0f46f1b17c03683f72cc5986c6a6fabdf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "41415bfc18c50a24c187631df532d2f0f46f1b17c03683f72cc5986c6a6fabdf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I think we, we others, have a right to complain.",
      "output_sha256": "987139d7bb9124c8ee182e5b49e3e0ee5edcbf7d6e0441bf00bcedeabbfb0a2b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "987139d7bb9124c8ee182e5b49e3e0ee5edcbf7d6e0441bf00bcedeabbfb0a2b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "However lucky we may be in other ways, if we have not this luck of inanimate things we have a right to complain.",
      "output_sha256": "350a2c2faf3aedc6fbe5f7647461deaab64a17ef4d03539193c00ef97c145d66",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "350a2c2faf3aedc6fbe5f7647461deaab64a17ef4d03539193c00ef97c145d66",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "While it may be gratifying to win £500 on the Stock Exchange purely by chance, there is always a shadow over this joy.",
      "output_sha256": "f6a1833712253d409b1d69d1e0ef0380ff63456ecd5a491b233e4896bc7675d1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": 0.426171,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b4cf90b050bf806c1f295ee5f82b6a056be7196846bb0ce229adaab9e7afadf4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f6a1833712253d409b1d69d1e0ef0380ff63456ecd5a491b233e4896bc7675d1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        36,
        37
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The next £500 earned through clever investment will surely be attributed to luck.",
      "output_sha256": "b5e4c9e62a63d753f58b3af0042c06a7852f1b865d7ea49a590c750489aae2d6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": 0.426171,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b4cf90b050bf806c1f295ee5f82b6a056be7196846bb0ce229adaab9e7afadf4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b5e4c9e62a63d753f58b3af0042c06a7852f1b865d7ea49a590c750489aae2d6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        36,
        37
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Luck is given the credit of all our successes, but the other man is given the credit of all his luck.",
      "output_sha256": "80867cf6602a7e2db17e79ec3e451f7db6532249377743e4d13387a772ad5d2b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "80867cf6602a7e2db17e79ec3e451f7db6532249377743e4d13387a772ad5d2b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "That is why we have a right to complain.",
      "output_sha256": "821d2b44479bc4d91e590064deb8fd088fb2b4e9befe66dd7b24bcd3828ae9d8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "821d2b44479bc4d91e590064deb8fd088fb2b4e9befe66dd7b24bcd3828ae9d8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I cannot comprehend why inanimate objects seem to conspire against certain individuals.",
      "output_sha256": "31f4941e0fc51e8376616dd2bfef7c24106172a4c052a75b125e2da97221566d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": 0.424855,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a867ba9d3d325491648c32f57e700fe806caa8cfbfbeae93c46e921c016b1ddd"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_ai_sha256": "31f4941e0fc51e8376616dd2bfef7c24106172a4c052a75b125e2da97221566d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Perhaps there is some justice in it.",
      "output_sha256": "48ae463c44a6b34b7a8e69f5cc3148c9fcf0c81d4b05375beacb7ac40f184302",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "48ae463c44a6b34b7a8e69f5cc3148c9fcf0c81d4b05375beacb7ac40f184302",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "It might be the case—indeed, it’s likely—that those favored by objects are despised by animals, children, and even their fellow humans.",
      "output_sha256": "be5d999460c0c97c296f73da4310a2f40af547be925c8c9f3f13b157b1507685",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": 0.394466,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a0c50072db1d76f232f2736dac2398b6ea0d5f45a70f1c0ac76b97203a27fb3d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_ai_sha256": "be5d999460c0c97c296f73da4310a2f40af547be925c8c9f3f13b157b1507685",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        42
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Certainly he is hated by me.",
      "output_sha256": "5d6b7135e3ddea2df52461652ef074a405aeb1991540fa9e69c75e3048b7d75f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "5d6b7135e3ddea2df52461652ef074a405aeb1991540fa9e69c75e3048b7d75f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Indeed, the more I think of him, the more I see that he is not a nice man in any way.",
      "output_sha256": "90d7b27112e89c2a3d257a816de74e4074712050c6d30a88973ad4ecaa235a12",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "90d7b27112e89c2a3d257a816de74e4074712050c6d30a88973ad4ecaa235a12",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The gods have neglected him; he has no good qualities.",
      "output_sha256": "cdead4938aa621f76a7292c1ed6d2cbdc517706f7e3eb179ad0f6816a333df37",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "cdead4938aa621f76a7292c1ed6d2cbdc517706f7e3eb179ad0f6816a333df37",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "He is a worm.",
      "output_sha256": "b7167a5f2ac821a7609c0bb5d9866a71ee2101e6d81fa8fe9076fc3585a669b2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "b7167a5f2ac821a7609c0bb5d9866a71ee2101e6d81fa8fe9076fc3585a669b2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "No wonder, then, that this small compensation is doled out to him—the gift of getting on with inanimate things.",
      "output_sha256": "0170c0a2e4fd4d5af2412d8f89b12e305fd62cc7eb06e3d154866456ccacbfa6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "0170c0a2e4fd4d5af2412d8f89b12e305fd62cc7eb06e3d154866456ccacbfa6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "This gives him (with the unthinking) a certain reputation for readiness and dexterity.",
      "output_sha256": "32868c6baf65662f82569dd6c13504e0cbdb59a7b5b8ce5b85f8eacb02d391a0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_human_sha256": "32868c6baf65662f82569dd6c13504e0cbdb59a7b5b8ce5b85f8eacb02d391a0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "If ever you meet a man with such a reputation, you will know what he really is.",
      "output_sha256": "239dfd6dfc6384b753ce60debde292bb35f3b72f15e484873c41927484c81382",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "239dfd6dfc6384b753ce60debde292bb35f3b72f15e484873c41927484c81382",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "This morning, circumstances dictated that I write this piece while clad in a dressing gown.",
      "output_sha256": "1221e747b6e95b11824b05fa9f0dc5cfa012f4f5d7cc49962fa497382b0a4dfe",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": 0.479607,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        49
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8fd5bd40ed4afb090c16bc73bd92a582b01937c6f41d0a498507fee13cfd5a37"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1221e747b6e95b11824b05fa9f0dc5cfa012f4f5d7cc49962fa497382b0a4dfe",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        48
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I shall now put on a collar.",
      "output_sha256": "bbcd594e88019e1a1ecde41d3fb708ab1a6392f42a69ab7435ae03608db1f768",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "bbcd594e88019e1a1ecde41d3fb708ab1a6392f42a69ab7435ae03608db1f768",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "My hope is that it will produce a squeak.",
      "output_sha256": "16654ae1aeaa5bccdaf84e687785ccbae9b89388898e3b5e28a8aff6340c4356",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": 0.593254,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1e764f198319bae708ebd23c3b333621be88c490a53b5458c2d197d0e534a776"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_ai_sha256": "16654ae1aeaa5bccdaf84e687785ccbae9b89388898e3b5e28a8aff6340c4356",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        50
      ]
    }
  ]
}
